(177, 177, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you want my feedback by email or in person tomorrow?', '피드백을 이메일로 받을래요, 내일 직접 들을래요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/177/5bddea3468d2c7ceebc63c7bb1f4bdeb029cefbec99e559e2f8f74413b6a65d4.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(178, 178, 'EN', 'KR', 'Tell me which part of the grade surprised you most, and I will explain it.', '성적에서 가장 뜻밖이었던 부분을 말해 주세요. 제가 설명해 드릴게요.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/178/dce2a745284dd42fba48e7f14d6526df632aea41845fa7e214c69ab0bb0f8e5c.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(179, 179, 'EN', 'KR', 'Your main idea was clear, but you needed stronger examples. How could you improve that next time?', '중심 생각은 분명했지만 더 좋은 예시가 필요했어요. 다음에는 어떻게 보완할 수 있을까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/179/fed13d741aa863f6a80719163bf6ca9a47a937fb6b47c18954c64b3f673969be.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(180, 180, 'EN', 'KR', 'I can send detailed feedback by email or meet tomorrow. Which would help you more?', '자세한 피드백을 이메일로 보내거나 내일 만날 수 있어요. 어느 쪽이 더 도움이 될까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/180/75cf75cd9b3d8b2964fb13e9ecef43f0d290345f8c9a8b96514381d1ef125c0c.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(181, 181, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you study in the morning or at night?', '아침에 공부해, 밤에 공부해?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/181/42c76fa51341f16306f9e542aeda7fb0dff71d9598bd073f3585a33af4b369a4.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '공부하는 시간을 물으면 쉬운 이야기부터 시작할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(182, 182, 'EN', 'KR', 'Can we study chapter five together?', '우리 5단원을 같이 공부할래?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/182/c2f52a3a27f70672f235fb1bc33434f5f1be7a22073e6560ebae2025a308fb1e.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(183, 183, 'EN', 'KR', 'If we study together, should we meet at the library after class?', '같이 공부한다면 수업 후에 도서관에서 만날까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/183/081f716617f0dc8ae6a36725b5978318922f29588237e7933351cc3bee232ff5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(184, 184, 'EN', 'KR', 'When do you study best, and where do you usually study?', '언제 공부가 가장 잘되고, 보통 어디서 공부해?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/184/e96a1b03f2d64eea3cf0e3f7d858d41b27086956feac3fc23b1e8a19a696137a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '평소 공부 시간을 물으면 서로 맞는 계획을 찾기 쉽겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(185, 185, 'EN', 'KR', 'Chapter five is difficult for me. Could we review it together after class?', '나는 5단원이 어려워. 수업 후에 같이 복습할 수 있을까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/185/9b9392ed4f7c34e4c558cda96fb5fb378d6d955ecb72eee4f8018c8dd9dddec1.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(186, 186, 'EN', 'KR', 'If we study together, would the library at four or the cafe at five work better?', '같이 공부한다면 4시에 도서관과 5시에 카페 중 어디가 더 좋아?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/186/84a33df65272388491b102e032bdde0af84c09974e2f9ef1808d1917cbddd73a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(187, 187, 'EN', 'KR', 'What makes you happy: good food, fun games, or time with friends?', '맛있는 음식, 재미있는 게임, 친구와 보내는 시간 중 무엇이 너를 행복하게 해?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/187/f82f5e9937d7305828b1706fd8713f3e4bc520b44c5e9961a723be1df816f46e.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '행복하게 하는 쉬운 일을 물으면 주제에 부담 없이 들어갈 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(188, 188, 'EN', 'KR', 'Can money buy some of those things?', '돈으로 그중 몇 가지를 살 수 있을까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/188/16f4db2db832236d1f767a605e75a91a905d56bd187922bcd6762bf6b44f8fe7.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(189, 189, 'EN', 'KR', 'What is one happy thing that costs no money?', '돈이 들지 않는 행복한 일 한 가지는 뭐야?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/189/b98b190026f14c52c27f2d276187938a0548987b57db642366087847da134b12.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(190, 190, 'EN', 'KR', 'Money can buy food, games, and trips. Which of these can make people happy?', '돈으로 음식, 게임, 여행을 살 수 있어. 그중 무엇이 사람을 행복하게 할 수 있을까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/190/d64084e7a526e4a1080cdf03ea7bdd2bba7dc189861ed65e680adc1ebd23abe0.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '돈으로 살 수 있는 즐거움부터 생각하면 토론 주제를 쉽게 이해할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(191, 191, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you think money makes life easier? Give one simple example.', '돈이 삶을 더 편하게 만든다고 생각해? 쉬운 예를 하나 들어줘.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/191/2e6242811f52bd036f787ee2560347a39f0645c120129898c64be558c11c4cfe.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(192, 192, 'EN', 'KR', 'What free activity can make a person happy? Give one example.', '돈이 들지 않으면서 사람을 행복하게 하는 활동은 뭐가 있을까? 예를 하나 들어줘.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/192/3433a06dc3c8b02e9c5c7a28980707aa82a56e88b5151b1ad955793deb4833a8.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(193, 193, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hi! Do you like quiet flights or talking with the person next to you?', '안녕하세요! 조용히 가는 것과 옆 사람과 이야기하는 것 중 어느 쪽을 좋아하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/193/a69b832d743afc2f14033c3ebfc7a8577bc03c5c4910d29c9e2f09a0833b5515.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '조용히 가고 싶은지 이야기하고 싶은지 물으면 편하게 대화를 시작할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(194, 194, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you like window seats or aisle seats?', '창가 좌석과 통로 좌석 중 어디를 좋아하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/194/7284653aaf41d2dc8a05a4a23fb4d1cb925e10a6f6b675113503b2d2e0459693.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(195, 195, 'EN', 'KR', 'Where are you going, and what will you do there?', '어디로 가시고, 그곳에서 무엇을 할 예정이세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/195/7a1a5adb327613392be2a6c3fbdf45990d26adc4c454a20b386c3bfc19cd019a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(196, 196, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hi, I''m sitting next to you. Do you prefer a quiet flight or some conversation?', '안녕하세요, 옆자리에 앉게 됐네요. 조용히 가는 것과 이야기하는 것 중 어느 쪽이 좋아요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/196/99e7b284e2fb9832574d0995b70af97e250edadafac417843609ca49f250cf24.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '대화를 원하는지 먼저 확인하면 옆자리에서도 부담 없이 말을 걸 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(197, 197, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you prefer window or aisle seats, and what do you like about them?', '창가와 통로 좌석 중 어디를 더 좋아하고, 어떤 점이 좋아요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/197/1e45995eb6c53f3521869531d993ec38e1cc53c73e8b167a5caac5749ebd5c7f.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(198, 198, 'EN', 'KR', 'Where are you headed, and what are you planning to do there?', '어디로 가시고, 그곳에서 무엇을 할 계획이세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/198/0e6ef303194cad6365c8684b9225583575449987a3ce94e15f61bdd62b7e66bc.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(199, 199, 'EN', 'KR', 'I''m sorry. Can you show me the broken part?', '죄송합니다. 파손된 부분을 보여주시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/199/75629bd867e2dcb486e26db485000774c4fb4e77ff72b3378f5f8f0f7d548a7d.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(200, 200, 'EN', 'KR', 'We can give you money or a travel coupon. Which do you want?', '현금이나 여행 쿠폰으로 보상해 드릴 수 있어요. 어느 쪽이 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/200/979058ad1d7c5e63e88e4556b346a7777318d1317abd8d04f7b8b8806ca4e369.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(201, 201, 'EN', 'KR', 'Is there anything else I can help you with?', '더 도와드릴 건 없을까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/201/3ad873f575c526e92f2ad0cbe420c75e451b9ef8de4839b56a30ff3293d963a0.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(202, 202, 'EN', 'KR', 'I''m sorry about the damage. Please show me the broken part and explain the problem.', '파손되어 죄송합니다. 부서진 부분을 보여주시고 문제를 설명해 주세요.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/202/b461eca13e90ae2fe6d687d31adceabd77ecd96fb754c02d176969bd84e4aa7b.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(203, 203, 'EN', 'KR', 'We can offer cash, miles, or a travel voucher. Which kind of compensation would you prefer?', '현금, 마일리지, 여행 바우처로 보상할 수 있어요. 어떤 보상을 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/203/2ed6dc4b8aa38ac264463afab9c2f5aa3efb13c7c4757b469ad52e1218d38be5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(204, 204, 'EN', 'KR', 'Is there anything else I can help you with?', '더 도와드릴 건 없을까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/204/3ad873f575c526e92f2ad0cbe420c75e451b9ef8de4839b56a30ff3293d963a0.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(205, 205, 'EN', 'KR', 'Welcome! What name is the reservation under?', '어서 오세요! 어떤 이름으로 예약하셨나요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/205/84f521171459d455264a493895af95e32b203e1924f6eb329a8942991293d96c.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '예약자 이름부터 확인하면 체크인을 쉽게 시작할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(206, 206, 'EN', 'KR', 'Your room will be ready in one hour. Is that okay?', '객실은 한 시간 뒤에 준비돼요. 괜찮으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/206/9c5a7c5f01977dffb1c03b6c45158a4970c082acb1cc95bbe804ca6f1d4144fa.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(207, 207, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you want a high floor or a low floor?', '높은 층과 낮은 층 중 어디를 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/207/7f54e8e0bc7a1c8fe9d4c7bff4ca36578105bc5aecbc2c0e50900fe90e1ce03f.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(208, 208, 'EN', 'KR', 'Welcome to the hotel. Could I have the name on your reservation?', '호텔에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 예약자 성함을 알려주시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/208/944b02d98368c70f9b3788d69fe599a14cfb98aa5c1eff5a7b761dd22938421a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '예약 정보를 먼저 확인하면 체크인 절차를 차분히 진행할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(209, 209, 'EN', 'KR', 'Your room needs one more hour. Would you like to wait here or leave your bags with us?', '객실 준비에 한 시간 더 필요해요. 여기서 기다리실래요, 짐을 맡기실래요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/209/f33db334910692c86a2e324af7c0c3724b023894a818c1e28928897329dfd2c9.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(210, 210, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you prefer a higher floor or a room away from the elevator?', '높은 층과 엘리베이터에서 먼 방 중 어느 쪽을 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/210/14447a13fe7776c99d913b8ee9f2c0f879d6cf7ddc525f2177907d4010105d72.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(211, 211, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hi. Would you like to get coffee with me?', '안녕하세요. 저와 커피 마실래요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/211/3e9c9337cc17e39901c5c7866551f4346041bb100c28711076548edae27adf10.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '커피 제안을 분명하게 하면 상대가 편하게 답할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(212, 212, 'EN', 'KR', 'I understand. Do you want me to leave now?', '알겠어요. 제가 이제 가면 될까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/212/b28e17729962054589c0d7f8b9a1b3893f5c758eab4e7a5099d9619dc27072f4.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(213, 213, 'EN', 'KR', 'Okay. Have a nice day!', '알겠어요. 좋은 하루 보내세요!', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/213/6cef8f0a416fc89d63ca39952358a0eb2e281bc21d438f086966c333155d54b7.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(214, 214, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hi, sorry to stop you. Would you be interested in getting coffee sometime?', '안녕하세요, 붙잡아서 죄송해요. 언제 커피 한잔하실래요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/214/89db493b62a5a39fffb55b4c945c74a961222ddca14fbbdd0e4feb30b2e2855f.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '부담 없이 제안하되 거절할 수 있는 여지를 줘야겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(215, 215, 'EN', 'KR', 'No problem. Would you prefer that I leave you alone?', '괜찮아요. 제가 더 이상 말을 걸지 않는 게 좋을까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/215/b4ea73ad44d9180e1f5d5008fd2ae743ea1373a503e67d5f547797eecf5480ba.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(216, 216, 'EN', 'KR', 'I understand. Thanks for being clear, and have a good day.', '알겠어요. 분명히 말씀해 주셔서 감사하고, 좋은 하루 보내세요.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/216/b9532b4bc8209c3cc12ab577f579bd55bc968f8502bae8c6542b610468f17fa5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(217, 217, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hi! What drink would you like?', '안녕하세요! 어떤 음료를 드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/217/47cb353c320f373aeb23ee838f18ebe2e9917db3fc98bf3fdbba98e04ccce8e3.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '메뉴를 바로 물으면 손님이 쉽게 주문할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(218, 218, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you want it hot or cold?', '따뜻하게 드릴까요, 차갑게 드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/218/b67555f1d9fd308df1c83311fe5dd98fcd384af855bf414198ed6284f4bb2047.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(219, 219, 'EN', 'KR', 'Will you drink it here or take it with you?', '여기서 드실 건가요, 가지고 가실 건가요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/219/c4031e7454cecdb302e6cb2f413182df365237d26ff3fdd949a91715f9219a97.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(220, 220, 'EN', 'KR', 'Welcome! What would you like to drink today?', '어서 오세요! 오늘 어떤 음료를 드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/220/b1ebea3a36eea7a7d8cbbec8c65d89182da4a0783385f212bc70596f6198abef.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '원하는 음료부터 확인하면 주문을 자연스럽게 이어갈 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(221, 221, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you like it hot or iced, and what size would you like?', '따뜻하게 드릴까요, 아이스로 드릴까요? 크기는 어떻게 하시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/221/693c25622d00af899bd93845c859943ddbead0c1a0df967bd967a71f158d06e5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(222, 222, 'EN', 'KR', 'Is that for here or to go?', '드시고 가세요, 포장이세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/222/02fd355e56c6cd31ff4044752c9ca0da8926a2357563fa9633f9ea231fc601d4.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(223, 223, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hello. Where does it hurt?', '안녕하세요. 어디가 아프세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/223/ec518a98c557ccdb813b73dfa355f68931817fd499acea956b5dfba50d47efed.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '어디가 아픈지 먼저 물으면 필요한 도움을 쉽게 줄 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(224, 224, 'EN', 'KR', 'We have pills or liquid medicine. Which is easier for you?', '알약과 물약이 있어요. 어느 쪽이 더 편하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/224/6b0811044aba21c32a5d881bf518c83e6ccc216e9e9d683120bc1d709c54dba4.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(225, 225, 'EN', 'KR', 'Please follow the directions on the label. Do you need help reading them?', '약에 적힌 방법대로 드세요. 읽는 걸 도와드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/225/7a1ae13cc0393fad269de6f277744332f9af6dab55b20dc826e746ba657ea1c9.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(226, 226, 'EN', 'KR', 'Hello. Please tell me where it hurts and how you feel right now.', '안녕하세요. 지금 어디가 아프고 어떤 느낌인지 말씀해 주세요.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/226/30edfc94901b4611a407446a859034f8d861983a8ddfb523e8c0cb4db358b434.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '현재 증상을 간단히 확인하면 알맞은 약을 안내할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(227, 227, 'EN', 'KR', 'This medicine comes as tablets or liquid. Which type would be easier for you?', '이 약은 알약과 물약이 있어요. 어느 쪽이 더 편하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/227/1c02d1d8b5380b0d59f5afabb03347761099aa618870e3e95ac8625e0fd5832c.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(228, 228, 'EN', 'KR', 'Please follow the dose on the label. Would you like me to explain when and how to take it?', '약에 적힌 복용량을 지켜주세요. 언제 어떻게 먹는지 설명해 드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/228/22b6a6d65699122270df3157d265e10c54e3a9b323e802c13d564454a4ca3d9d.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(229, 229, 'EN', 'KR', 'Use the east exit. Do you see the blue sign?', '동쪽 출구로 가세요. 파란 표지판이 보이나요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/229/fcf863a25f1ebdb3e33d7a75534aff2d07c5a57cff9a025f1ef6ea457cd50751.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(230, 230, 'EN', 'KR', 'Walk straight for five minutes, then turn left. Is that clear?', '5분 동안 곧장 간 뒤 왼쪽으로 도세요. 이해되셨나요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/230/c760a84040144edac0774b3420fb9152035371c087f781b224a1791112990a19.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(231, 231, 'EN', 'KR', 'Is this your first time in London?', '런던은 처음이세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/231/d3f16a438ce9663191fcd42a01bca5536b328d41abcd17ff05387987029d3bc5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(232, 232, 'EN', 'KR', 'Take the east exit by the blue sign. Can you see it from here?', '파란 표지판 옆 동쪽 출구로 나가세요. 여기서 보이시나요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/232/cf923cab164ae09ce562012edb69b3c8425538ee3788ff28578645169f013f3d.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(233, 233, 'EN', 'KR', 'Walk straight for five minutes and turn left at the bank. Would you like me to repeat that?', '5분쯤 곧장 가서 은행에서 왼쪽으로 도세요. 다시 말씀드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/233/40a12d1f602da42ca41b4d08850c66f385b2817745557f9fe2779c4219fb2aab.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(234, 234, 'EN', 'KR', 'Is this your first visit to London? How are you enjoying it so far?', '런던은 처음이세요? 지금까지 지내보니 어떠세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/234/75d3118dc7ed0ecced12fd2f0f2d53c60e98d25b0621cde9ac21619b24e548b3.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(235, 235, 'EN', 'KR', 'What was your favorite trip?', '가장 좋았던 여행은 뭐야?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/235/7476cc43e92ee93c6f34176929ea3d7df47f525e9e811dc2e7ae122a2ab1e9c1.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '좋아하는 여행 장소를 물으면 쉽게 이야기를 시작할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(236, 236, 'EN', 'KR', 'What did you like there?', '그곳에서 어떤 점이 좋았어?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/236/4f4abb6b90ffca7ee8444c4a2a4318983095b69bb616f6ae02cc2f60d6cf7167.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(237, 237, 'EN', 'KR', 'Where do you want to go next?', '다음에는 어디에 가고 싶어?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/237/94c22a7a2297464e8657a57f8b5add4eb5b36a25d4210bd55ca3860b16cac6d5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(238, 238, 'EN', 'KR', 'Tell me about a trip you enjoyed. Where did you go?', '즐거웠던 여행 이야기를 해줘. 어디에 갔어?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/238/7b33e7a65d9b7115b55abc46f6c690c3d47a21072791c7e403ce296a6f250ecc.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '좋아하는 여행지를 물으면 부담 없이 경험과 취향을 나눌 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(239, 239, 'EN', 'KR', 'What did you enjoy most about that trip?', '그 여행에서 무엇이 가장 좋았어?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/239/98f4943747474d431b8ed435d1f5fb4c91ce4711809e205475ba6cd6a0257c5d.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(240, 240, 'EN', 'KR', 'Choose one place you want to visit next and tell me why.', '다음에 가고 싶은 곳 하나와 그 이유를 말해줘.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/240/3ca21431ada346c107561205b76abda36d0df086f1e660a4c1024b5feb9ff009.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(241, 241, 'EN', 'KR', 'I can give you a spare key or open the door for you. Which do you want?', '여분의 키를 드리거나 문을 열어드릴 수 있어요. 어느 쪽이 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/241/d614f25ee3eaa53a654c42b0bb1d2f00c4afa6b20ca9d21c8f1ea98f48da790e.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(242, 242, 'EN', 'KR', 'Your new key can be ready tomorrow. Is morning okay?', '새 키는 내일 준비돼요. 오전에 괜찮으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/242/dc467e7cef813fd1c8e457cc8a660566a2969fd24c97fc7c62e1638379f03576.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(243, 243, 'EN', 'KR', 'Should we call you or send a text?', '전화드릴까요, 문자를 보내드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/243/11405f65fe89487c877305c5ed1b027a2f2a9f8db20a23b1a7d61490d9373d8e.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(244, 244, 'EN', 'KR', 'We can lend you a temporary key or have a staff member open your door. Which would help more?', '임시 키를 빌려드리거나 직원이 문을 열어드릴 수 있어요. 어느 쪽이 더 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/244/c8481f2846f1f4c1812bc7a7bff5d65272164ca32184d2e5360533bcc72ac5a7.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(245, 245, 'EN', 'KR', 'A replacement key can be ready tomorrow morning or afternoon. When can you pick it up?', '새 키는 내일 오전이나 오후에 준비돼요. 언제 찾으러 오실 수 있나요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/245/342bfb75c9850bf777ff35c8b50f6f408666d9453f41bcde29a130f7acb5b08f.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(246, 246, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you like a text or a phone call when it''s ready?', '준비되면 문자와 전화 중 어떤 방법으로 알려드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/246/6d485cfeb69ed866a0fdfdae71ca0a2c3c8a4d5ed8f1aba0c8dcc5dcd29ee5c1.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(247, 247, 'EN', 'KR', 'Let''s write our names on our food. Is that okay?', '음식에 우리 이름을 쓰자. 괜찮아?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/247/a85d15591b88984874cfd99d8d6da29c71824eb19807991ed3b52c44ed653d20.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '음식에 이름을 쓰는 간단한 규칙부터 제안해야겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(248, 248, 'EN', 'KR', 'If food has no name, should we ask before throwing it away?', '음식에 이름이 없으면 버리기 전에 물어볼까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/248/e5424e444640536aa64a17b4094299a1e9be6053ab4e74c93938dd2154de1b55.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(249, 249, 'EN', 'KR', 'Should we clean the fridge on Friday or Sunday?', '냉장고는 금요일과 일요일 중 언제 정리할까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/249/36afbcd308d6db174602701570fd2545aa297bae3c83bf22e5a940c446c835f7.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(250, 250, 'EN', 'KR', 'We could write names on personal food and use a green sticker for shared food. What do you think?', '개인 음식에는 이름을 쓰고 같이 먹는 음식에는 초록 스티커를 붙이면 어때?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/250/fed7fe2118157a6c34997c730a87144e1db5c0167b29a3dc95b6ffca6b4b2799.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '이름과 공유 표시를 나누면 냉장고를 쉽게 정리할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(251, 251, 'EN', 'KR', 'For food with no name, should we ask in the group chat before throwing it away?', '이름 없는 음식은 버리기 전에 단체 채팅방에 물어볼까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/251/197093018c88fc5bb16f32e60ef5064251b1a42955469328258996438aa7f277.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(252, 252, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would Friday or Sunday be better for cleaning the fridge?', '냉장고 정리는 금요일과 일요일 중 언제가 더 좋아?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/252/8e70f99272c196d24f2c734a95a574a086916c2ff215a9172f5db26090f9277a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(253, 253, 'EN', 'KR', 'I have your white shirt, and I think you have my blue one. Can you see it?', '네 흰 셔츠가 나한테 있고, 내 파란 셔츠는 너한테 있는 것 같아. 보여?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/253/e65d81b95f1bb06f22eb7173d9c3550e3f01225c457ac932cc9d76f9feb492fc.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '서로의 옷 색을 알려주면 쉽게 찾아볼 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(254, 254, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you want to use the dryer together?', '건조기를 같이 쓸래?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/254/0e83b9030508398bfdf77355247a1d067de8387b84f4eb23c242a20792438e9a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(255, 255, 'EN', 'KR', 'Next time, should we send a text when clothes get mixed up?', '다음에 옷이 섞이면 문자할까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/255/19be2ab49e1b19b53e4c3b6d77842afadeecdb233430d83e5624f0643fca9aa3.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(256, 256, 'EN', 'KR', 'Our laundry got mixed up. I found your white shirt. Could you look for my blue one?', '우리 빨래가 섞였어. 네 흰 셔츠는 찾았어. 내 파란 셔츠도 찾아줄래?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/256/c5aac731f18844895c729215a9d8ab6651d3e130abe034f0033a55eefc49de1a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '찾는 옷을 분명히 말하면 서로 바로 확인할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(257, 257, 'EN', 'KR', 'The dryer is cheaper if we share it. Would you like to use it together or separately?', '건조기는 같이 쓰면 더 저렴해. 같이 쓸래, 따로 쓸래?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/257/478d6f0da7c5b702738c301800e331f252cc6132bbffe5e728e3c6a4f1a12072.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(258, 258, 'EN', 'KR', 'If this happens again, should we text each other or leave the clothes by the door?', '다음에 또 이러면 서로 문자할까, 아니면 방문 앞에 옷을 둘까?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/258/3f6a363ed2dbf2e1c75ff38f95cbfdaccf3a0ff5955ef77a0e36cb0e6c25f686.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(259, 259, 'EN', 'KR', 'Please stop using the sink. Do you need a towel or a bucket?', '세면대 사용을 멈춰주세요. 수건이나 양동이가 필요하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/259/50fc31d4f7e3e69afbfaffc51f59ced55c3e9e9eb70601ce88c2a8e23c7c6516.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(260, 260, 'EN', 'KR', 'We can come today at six or tomorrow at nine. Which time is good?', '오늘 6시나 내일 9시에 갈 수 있어요. 어느 시간이 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/260/0320bd07889f7cc7f690be4b4ffc52c2a2f4fbd614cd8f05bf1b99809fadd9b1.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(261, 261, 'EN', 'KR', 'Should the worker call you before coming?', '직원이 가기 전에 전화드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/261/1d404344a09dfda578bc71c05fd2a565e52dac2fb5150472f7164ebc2f1d48d9.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(262, 262, 'EN', 'KR', 'Please don''t use the sink for now. Would you like a bucket, or help turning off the water?', '지금은 세면대를 쓰지 마세요. 양동이를 드릴까요, 아니면 물 잠그는 걸 도와드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/262/47d7c448181f1490a2a2e8c41dcfeb7b672fadb1d44d9c42d65c7cf96622a2a8.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(263, 263, 'EN', 'KR', 'A worker can visit at six today or nine tomorrow. Which appointment works for you?', '직원이 오늘 6시나 내일 9시에 방문할 수 있어요. 어느 시간이 괜찮으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/263/ebd7bde705571051290f19dccdb3fb1cbf5de20fed7652a8e5f3bda978f17d9c.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(264, 264, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you like the worker to call or text before arriving?', '직원이 방문하기 전에 전화와 문자 중 어떤 방법으로 연락드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/264/ef5331ad082d55389821a3875b8ea01a686ead25c4c5e17631d5c07828daa565.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(265, 265, 'EN', 'KR', 'Please clean the room and remove your things. Do you want a checklist?', '방을 청소하고 짐을 빼주세요. 확인 목록을 드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/265/33881e3eff36695780f3527a5708d5ff15c68f12e69c95c4ca5e5f8f81bfda8a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '청소 목록과 함께 점검 준비를 쉽게 알려줘야겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(266, 266, 'EN', 'KR', 'We can check the room today at three or tomorrow at ten. Which time is good?', '오늘 3시나 내일 10시에 방을 확인할 수 있어요. 어느 시간이 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/266/b621385d285c4968e0a5b74706293848ffe0431501f6b1f2da1778ea26d1d12b.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(267, 267, 'EN', 'KR', 'If you have photos from move-in, please bring them. If not, tell us about the old damage.', '입주 때 찍은 사진이 있으면 가져와 주세요. 없다면 원래 있던 파손을 알려주세요.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/267/84258355912ad4fa5dbd25e966d82d96be95afd0b74e10f7798a8f5eb8947857.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(268, 268, 'EN', 'KR', 'Before the inspection, remove your things and clean the room. Would a checklist help you?', '점검 전에 짐을 빼고 방을 청소해 주세요. 확인 목록이 필요하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/268/5af82602063a35183e54ffde6d717ca95341c0cf8d13d33a401661547439c11e.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '필요한 준비를 짧게 안내하고 확인 목록이 필요한지 물어봐야겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(269, 269, 'EN', 'KR', 'Inspection times are three today and ten tomorrow. Which one should I reserve?', '점검 시간은 오늘 3시와 내일 10시예요. 언제로 예약해 드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/269/86c13be25e973c3c1d25b5802f4577da1aeb2783c776bc92e018ee880beb4d7b.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(270, 270, 'EN', 'KR', 'Damage may reduce your deposit. Bring any move-in photos you have. If you have none, tell us the damage was already there.', '파손이 있으면 보증금이 줄 수 있어요. 입주 때 찍은 사진이 있으면 가져오고, 없다면 원래부터 있던 파손이라고 알려주세요.', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/270/a2fcd795a14f03be24e3fbe306e8a24693f67b496b0c576a8d5948e50a2b9cae.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(271, 271, 'EN', 'KR', 'The direct train arrives at four and costs $45. The slower train arrives at five and costs $30. Which ticket do you want?', '직행 열차는 4시에 도착하고 45달러예요. 느린 열차는 5시에 도착하고 30달러예요. 어떤 표를 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/271/02bd9e5f9432289441edc0b3d773efd6aa34386c335a9a85a49debb6ab47eb6f.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(272, 272, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you want a paper ticket or a phone ticket?', '종이 표와 휴대폰 표 중 어떤 걸 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/272/3739a06b38b2d54e18a97744271ab1a0f89c72f31fe1819647ce47c6ea902f09.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(273, 273, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you like a window seat or an aisle seat?', '창가 좌석과 통로 좌석 중 어디가 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/273/4d08b55c31f9b48e4c2411022c2c00fa1153dc4abff8e645bfe0ea139a7e4e7d.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
