(287, 287, 'EN', 'KR', 'You can add lunch for $15. Would you like to include it?', '15달러를 추가하면 점심도 포함할 수 있어요. 추가하시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/287/c1b71f52cacfc953f94a072ff3bbb5a7ac5dd0c11971d0e77c96ff91b183660a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
