(290, 290, 'EN', 'KR', 'Should we send your new ticket by email or text?', '새 표를 이메일과 문자 중 어디로 보내드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/290/0b8efa7d7b3a1c25b39c06004dfbc6c0e86b63e3e1be18452c5c0b140d67c0ed.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(291, 291, 'EN', 'KR', 'We also have a food tour. Would you like more information?', '푸드 투어도 있어요. 더 알아보시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/291/fbb53d6fd87386a5976266b6db421d8ca9b82cff35e8f33258298d9aba4732b0.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(292, 292, 'EN', 'KR', 'Morning has a smaller group. Evening includes city lights and costs $10 more than your original booking. Which time would you prefer?', '오전은 인원이 적어요. 저녁은 야경이 포함되고 원래 예약보다 10달러가 더 들어요. 어느 시간이 더 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/292/619124376fa4999d1dbf3ec780b7221ccde20d369ff0860e1f14d3a709d53c4c.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(293, 293, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you like the new booking confirmation by email or text?', '새 예약 확인서를 이메일과 문자 중 어디로 보내드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/293/62013d6c6c42d04f0e42bc88e2637d2d8673a73edb3fb497ae435b019cbf6b8a.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(294, 294, 'EN', 'KR', 'We also offer a food tour and a night river cruise. Would you like to hear about either one?', '푸드 투어와 야간 리버 크루즈도 있어요. 둘 중 하나를 더 알아보시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/294/1fbb2db6c62842f41f87593db85b81b9d7ed90c6a15a0654a17e3f9f55da5d47.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(295, 295, 'EN', 'KR', 'A wider seat costs $50. The exit-row seat is free, but you must help in an emergency. Which do you want?', '더 넓은 좌석은 50달러예요. 비상구 좌석은 무료인데, 비상시에는 도와주셔야 해요. 어느 쪽이 좋으세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/295/327123b92fcc9fd91c1cc3a8cc491322425e7ca20f5e2e1600c0ca71a0fb268b.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '넓은 좌석의 가격을 바로 알려주면 쉽게 결정할 수 있겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(296, 296, 'EN', 'KR', 'We can check your bag for free. Would you like that?', '가방을 무료로 부쳐드릴 수 있어요. 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/296/9fcc2eeaa248569969eba352bbd1b6b7a538abb5546ed516dc498903cc827442.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(297, 297, 'EN', 'KR', 'Do you want your new boarding pass on paper or on your phone?', '새 탑승권을 종이와 휴대폰 중 어디로 받으시겠어요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/297/deafdec9814503ef3306e9f78d53d610f85b2c7c681fb07bc70396d0142668a5.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(298, 298, 'EN', 'KR', 'A seat with more legroom costs $50. The exit-row seat is free, but you must help in an emergency. Which would you prefer?', '다리 공간이 넓은 좌석은 50달러예요. 비상구 좌석은 무료인데, 비상시에는 도와주셔야 해요. 어느 쪽을 원하세요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/298/13b111675e1bf042a40b59b08e7d2cd236e15f6cca41d44851d5b67f699c51e7.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), '추가 공간과 가격을 함께 알려주면 좌석을 판단하기 쉽겠다.', 'GOOD'),
(299, 299, 'EN', 'KR', 'Overhead space is limited, so we can check your carry-on for free. Would you like that?', '기내 짐칸이 부족해서 가방을 무료로 부쳐드릴 수 있어요. 원하시나요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/299/8ca98ac106cd298b3c45611a108f0e1f562792bb91ddf468e7652ebee26ec0dc.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
(300, 300, 'EN', 'KR', 'Would you like the updated boarding pass printed or sent to your phone?', '새 탑승권을 출력해 드릴까요, 휴대폰으로 보내드릴까요?', 'https://d19azau1un4t7r.cloudfront.net/content/scenario-question-audio/300/4932a32f603a9c90f4f8735e6ef6752be2d09e26e5bb0161c81c0f9d152ca043.mp3', 'ACTIVE', now(), now(), NULL, NULL),
